{
  "_comment": "battle_monthly.json - the Battle Pass season track and the Monthly Ledger cards (WORK_ORDER_battle_and_monthly_packs). ADDITIVE AND SEPARATE FROM packs.json ON PURPOSE: packs.json is the PackDef shelf and this file carries the two shapes PackDef lacks (a tiered season, a 30-day claim table). Neither file's loader reads the other.",
  "_firewall": "ZERO COMBAT POWER, and it is a BUILD GATE, not a comment. No revive, no mid-battle heal or shield, no damage/armor/crit/attack-speed/cooldown modifier of any duration, no permanent passive, no stat or level-cap raise, no extra arena entry, no loot box or randomized reward, and NOTHING that references a tier index for sale. There is no 'combat' grant kind and BattleMonthlyRegression rejects one. Battle XP is EARNED BY PLAYING ONLY - no grant in this file may credit XP and no SKU may sell a tier (owner ruling Q4: NEVER SELL TIERS).",
  "_noGlimmer": "There is deliberately no 'glimmer' key anywhere in this schema. Owner ruling 2026-08-21 stripped glimmer from every pack ('nothing real and money has never been active') and a pass tier is pack contents by another name. Glimmer the CURRENCY is untouched and is still earned and spent elsewhere - do not 'fix' a failure here by deleting the currency.",
  "_grantSchema": "Grant.kind is one of: economy | convenience_token | cosmetic_sku | skr | bundle. economy carries wood/iron/food/crystals/coins. convenience_token carries {kind,count} and the kind must pass PackCatalog.IsRedeemableConvenience - LEGAL is not REDEEMABLE. cosmetic_sku and skr are declared so the shape is complete, and NO ROW IN THIS FILE USES EITHER: cosmetics cannot render (G1) and there is no SKR ledger (G2). bundle nests grants.",
  "version": 1,
  "battlePassSeasons": [
    {
      "seasonId": "season-emberwake",
      "name": "Emberwake",
      "tagline": "The first light of the month is the one you earn.",
      "_cadenceNote": "OWNER RULING 2026-08-21 (Q1): CALENDAR MONTH. A season starts on the 1st and runs the length of that month (28-31 days). startUtc/endUtc below are a TEMPLATE month; the interpreter derives the live window from the calendar and scales every xpRequired by actualDays/lengthDays, so a 28-day February and a 31-day March are equally completable (BattlePassSeason.XpRequiredScaled). Never re-author the curve per month.",
      "startUtc": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z",
      "endUtc": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
      "lengthDays": 30,
      "premiumPassSku": "",
      "_premiumPassSkuUnauthored": "DELIBERATELY EMPTY, and this is the honest state, not an oversight. Owner ruling Q3 makes the Season Pass buyable with EARNED SKR - and there is no SKR ledger in this build (ISkrLedger / LocalSkrLedger do not exist anywhere in the tree; the only occurrence of the name is a doc comment in IPiPlatform.cs), FeatureFlags.SkrPreview is defaultOn:false, and FeatureFlags.RealmStorePurchase is defaultOn:false with the mainnet block unlifted. Authoring a SKU here would put a Buy control on the Season Track screen that cannot complete, which is the WO-1118 vapor rule. While this is empty the track renders the premium lane as PREMIUM-LOCKED - rewards shown plainly, never hidden - and the footer says the lane is not purchasable yet. Fill this in the SAME change that lands the SKR writer and a real PackDef row; BattleMonthlyRegression asserts a non-empty value resolves to a real pack.",
      "xp": {
        "perWin": 100,
        "perLoss": 25,
        "perStreakStep": 10,
        "streakStepCap": 10,
        "perfectBonus": 0,
        "dailySoftCap": 1500,
        "softCapTaperPct": 0.5
      },
      "_perfectBonusNote": "0 AT LAUNCH by the re-verification default (Q5). The no-hit / flawless signal is not tracked anywhere yet, so a non-zero value here would be XP the player can never earn. Raise it in the same change that lands the signal.",
      "_rewardTableNote": "RESOURCE-ONLY, BY OWNER RULING 2026-08-21: 'DESIGN NOW, REWARD TABLES LATER'. Every reward in both lanes is wood/iron/food/crystals/coins, plus the ONE convenience kind that has a live redeemer in this build (lantern-oil-2x-expedition, consumed by Lantern.cs). NO cosmetic_sku row and NO skr row is authored anywhere in this file. Cosmetics land on a preview-tint fallback because no cosmetic art exists in the tree, and skr has nowhere to land at all. A 30-tier season that pays out invisible flags disappoints for a whole month instead of once. Author those lines on G1 (cosmetic art shipped) and G2 (SKR ledger written) - BattleMonthlyRegression FAILS the build if either kind is authored before its gate is open.",
      "_capstoneUnauthored": "Tier 30 is flagged isCapstone and pays a resource capstone. The season's PRESTIGE COSMETIC - the thing a capstone is actually for - is UNAUTHORED for the reason above. This row is the one most worth revisiting the moment G1 lands.",
